cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software release and the paper below."
title: "bi-kappa-distribution-sampling: bi-Kappa and related velocity samplers for kinetic plasma simulations"
abstract: >-
  Header-only C++11 samplers for bi-Kappa and bi-Maxwellian velocity
  distributions about an arbitrary magnetic-field direction, and for velocity
  and position distributions supplied by the user, for initializing
  particle-in-cell and hybrid simulations. A Python script tests a bi-Kappa
  velocity sample from any loader against the target distribution.
type: software
# Update date-released on the day the release is tagged.
date-released: 2026-09-24
authors:
